<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - B.A.T added to Goldman list.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - B.A.T added to Goldman list.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>B.A.T Industies Plc was added to the European &quot;recommended for purchase&quot; list at Goldman Sachs as analysts restarted coverage of the tobacco and insurance group, the investment bank said on Friday.</p>
<p>Goldman set a price target of 590p on the stock, which was down 1-1/2p at 501 by 1100 GMT.</p>
<p>Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
